Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Passione is an extensive mafia syndicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,At the bottom of an intricate totem pole\Nare groups of six to ten members, like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Above us are the Kapos, like Polpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Each Cape oversees their\Nown territory of business,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and each team has its focus, be it\Nassassinations, drugs, or otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,While I am part of the Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't involve myself with\Nother team members and Kapos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,At the head of the Family is the Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a trusted right-hand man with whom\Nhe maintains exclusive communication,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,so we have no means of\Nacquiring info about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Italian mafiosi hate attracting attention,\Nas it puts a target on their backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even capos will dress themselves\Nlike ordinary citizens,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and some even operate\Nfront businesses as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss is the most secretive of\Nall, and never reveals his identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.26,0:00:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Any investigative effort\Nis immediately uncovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.06,0:01:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know many who've tried and failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.84,0:01:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Giorno, if we ever want\Nto find our man of mystery,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to get him to notice us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to gain the trust\Nof someone close to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,or we'll never be able\Nto overthrow the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.18,0:01:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Our first job is to improve\Nour standing in the Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll earn the rank of Cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.58,0:01:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But you and I can't do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a team we can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.84,0:01:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to beat the\Nboss, this is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:03:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The news of Polpo's demise spread\Namong Passione's capos like wildfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The guys in intelligence say\Nthat it might have been suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, the big guy would never.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.38,0:03:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard was in a maximum security cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No one could get to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Think maybe he betrayed the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't find a more\Nloyal Cape than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no freaking way he'd do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.06,0:03:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but what I'm most worried\Nabout is who's gonna replace him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard through the grapevine\Nthat the capos are Fairy di Dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Papa committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, eyes on the road! I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.58,0:03:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Zillard has actually offed himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.74,0:03:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to watch the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knows why he did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he was just tired of being a slob,\Nor maybe life in lockup finally got to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.86,0:03:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever the reason, now we\Nknow he was a waste of hot gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn coward bit down on a pea shooter\Nand painted the walls with his brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.68,0:03:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure he killed himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone else could have did it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the autopsy guy\Ntold me it was suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.52,0:04:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Any expert worth a damn can tell the\Ndifference between suicide and murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.46,0:04:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a light, dunce!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know the rumors\Nabout Popo's fortune, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.10,0:04:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.01,0:04:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I know more about astrophysics\Nthan I do any damn rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Before Papa got locked up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,he converted some of his cash into\Na nice stash of rubies and gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,At least that's how I\Nremember the rumor going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.22,0:04:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a hidden treasure Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.28,0:04:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He had so much to own, not even the bank\Nor the family could handle it all. No
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,one had the balls to look for it while\Nthe inflatable idiot that was still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But now he's taking his eternal dirt map.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So his treasure is up for grabs. It's free\Nmoney, really, and the way I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He hit five billion lira
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.42,0:04:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you shitting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.24,0:04:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If I picked up that kind of moolah, I'd go\Nabroad with a bitchin' babe on each arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:04:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Get real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:04:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather work my way up in the Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I buy my way to Cape, I'll live\Na life most people can only dream of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But where the hell did he hide it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.08,0:05:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anyone who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No, although a thought\Noccurred to me just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy couldn't crawl out of that\Ncell without a crew of helpers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You think an oaf like that could hide\Nfive billion and loot all by himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He had to have had some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of loyal confrant type.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we all know, true\Nconfrants are few and far between.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Polpo liked Bucciarati, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean a tapista from Napoli?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If he had anyone hide it, it'd be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that Polpo's dead, Bucciarati\Nhas probably made his move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially with five billion\Nlira there for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure even he has a greedy\Nstreak when he's in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sookero!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:05:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard actually hopped\Nhis happy ass out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:05:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he believe that crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you're gonna try and tell\NBucciarati, I'd be real careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Word is, he and his\Ncronies are stand-users.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo, can we please be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's friggin' beautiful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,One day away from the\Nbooks isn't gonna hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, I'm just not\Ninto it today, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be commended.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.47,0:06:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not easy to ask\Nfor academic guidance,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.68,0:06:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when you barely\Nattended grade school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, you still learned\Nyour multiplication tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember what I taught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, multiply the six by five.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Six times five.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Six times five...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it thirty? It is! Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.40,0:06:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're practically halfway to solving it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Six times five is thirty! Nice! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:06:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell is this supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a strawberry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see what kind of\Ncake it is, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'd confuse the damn\Nthing with a chocolate or cheesecake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the problem here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.68,0:07:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's four slices!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They might as well have told us to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.98,0:07:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Another freak out, Mista? Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bad luck to take one of the\Nfour pieces, everybody knows that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Making a selection from five is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Choosing from three is also a safe move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But picking anything from a group of\Nfour practically invites disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was just a kid, a\Nneighborhood cat had four kittens,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and one of my friends ended\Nup adopting one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, much to his surprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.38,0:07:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,that fickle beast scratched my\Nfriend's eye clear out of the socket!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, he then beat that\Nkitty until it was dead and gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.66,0:07:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's some idiotic superstition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.14,0:07:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you eat one slice at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,eventually someone will have to\Nchoose one piece from the four.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is when the restaurant staff should\Ntake the hint and bring out three slices!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.18,0:07:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Service here sucks hot ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're more than welcome not to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I demand to eat Tortali Froggerie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.06,0:08:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All done, Fugo, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I get it right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fancy little punk shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can mess with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.78,0:08:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to\Nkeep teaching you this lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's definitely gone off the deep end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Abakyo, are you going to eat\Nthe rest of that cake or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A dense kagakatsu, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.06,0:08:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, talking down to\Npeople isn't very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll slice you to\Npieces for the whole...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dodo, bastardo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.18,0:08:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.38,0:08:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I could hear your bickering\Nfrom the front of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bothering the other customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've brought along the new\Nassociate we talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't dishonor us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Fugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you forgive me? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.60,0:09:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And I promise to study harder if\Nyou'll please keep teaching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.58,0:09:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I went out of my way to bring him here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Show him some respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.19,0:09:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, all of you properly\Nintroduce yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.22,0:09:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Capt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.13,0:09:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You should get to know your fellow\Nteam members while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.04,0:09:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there, take a load off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.38,0:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a drink and chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.26,0:10:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.38,0:10:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.29,0:10:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.88,0:10:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Signora Menini. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have time, could\Nyou lend me an ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking outside would be best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.90,0:10:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.62,0:10:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.53,0:10:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I got two whole years on you, buddy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.02,0:10:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already expressed\Nyour gratitude for the tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the sudden hesitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.92,0:11:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe we're past the niceties.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to drink up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it not warm enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.36,0:11:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's afraid to down it because\Nhe doesn't want to be one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.78,0:11:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.69,0:11:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what's going on here?\NNothing. Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He went to the trouble of making\Na special cup of tea for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nasty as hell!\NWhat'd you do? Speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.70,0:11:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He guzzled down every ounce of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be fun to have around!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.08,0:11:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Major props, bud!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you\Ndrank that stuff, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and tell us how you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you tell me, it'll\Nbe our little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.32,0:11:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Spill!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But you all are keeping abilities\Nunder wraps as well, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So this stronzo's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.30,0:12:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I transformed my left front\Ntooth into a jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And since it's 98 % water, it was able\Nto absorb all the liquid in the cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you transport matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be a hidden cavity!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.64,0:12:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's something\Nabout Jonah that gives
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,him the unique ability\Nto charm almost anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You think before you act.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A smart habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you told Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not exactly a cohesive team yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.14,0:12:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.30,0:12:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time for indecision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're heading out, so\Nbe ready! Huh? Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow me. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.14,0:12:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bucciarati! Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a great day, Signore!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop by my shop again sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to take you up on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.41,0:12:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I suspected,\Npeople really trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know there was\Nno way to avoid that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, this is one of my\Ndearest friends in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Her troubled son has recently started\Nbeating her and she's quite distraught.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no wonder you're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.60,0:13:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it clear he crossed the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your son's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.28,0:13:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep down, he's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.24,0:13:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But those damn drugs, they've changed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.40,0:13:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, I've lived in this\Nneighborhood for the past 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.52,0:13:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In all that time, I've never\Nbeen filled with such worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What would make him do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever been this scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.18,0:13:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you'll keep all of us\Nsafe, won't you, Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, you're one of us, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to hear you say the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.50,0:13:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you can rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.76,0:14:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So you meant we were going yachting?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get a hold of a yacht?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're renting one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't get to keep it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bucciarati, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor and stay away\Nfrom yacht number four, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.78,0:14:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll sink to our deaths. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The yacht looks like\Nit's in tip-top shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you like it so much, you take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like to rent a\Nyacht if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Prego, prego.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.96,0:14:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose whichever one\Ntickles your fancy the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just not number four. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll take\Nthe one on the far left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly, signore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fetch your keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm interested in renting\Nthe crap for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How much? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I could never take\Nmoney from you, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.36,0:14:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Use it as you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy mille.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, old guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:14:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here and ring me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah, this is the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Narancia. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.95,0:15:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, uh, I was gonna say, hey, I seem\Nto recall you buying a bunch of drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you say to selling me one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.67,0:15:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds great, but I know\Nyou're never going to pay up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, toss me a cold one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.36,0:15:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You want a cola or a fizzy water? Cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, a fizzy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see all the little bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:15:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All yours. Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, hold this book for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you're the best. Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.44,0:16:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did it just stop playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I just bought this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.70,0:16:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a shitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard sold me a dud!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That cheap geezer isn't\Ngoing to get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.23,0:16:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we've had just about enough\Nof the surprises, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.84,0:16:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you having this boat take us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.80,0:16:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're far enough away that\Nit's safe to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Our destination is Capri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's waiting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it we're not going\Nfor the amazing views. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So then what's the point of all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just lay it on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning the Cape\NPolpo killed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:16:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're shitting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.15,0:16:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.07,0:17:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The why is inconsequential.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Polpo was an influential\NCape who courted death daily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's focus back on Capri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How are the two connected?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.24,0:17:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Polpo was stashing away\Na vast personal fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A fortune worth...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten billion lira!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.88,0:17:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten billion?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.42,0:17:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm currently the only one\Nwho knows the location,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.32,0:17:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,as he ordered me to hide the treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.78,0:17:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That lira belongs to us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With capital like that,\Nwe'll claim the rank of Cape!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.18,0:17:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.06,0:17:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My prediction will come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.64,0:17:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's destined to become a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.48,0:17:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an opportunity born\Nof perseverance and hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't expect anything less.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Things just got a lot more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.95,0:17:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you stash that kind of\Ntreasure on Capri, Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.06,0:17:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.06,0:17:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Family has long spread rumors\Nabout the cache's whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we secure the goods,\Nwe must remain on high alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.51,0:18:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.20,0:18:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something, Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.77,0:18:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit messing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, you're gonna want to look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one lone shoe. Hand it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.96,0:18:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this is making a lick of sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell could he have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.06,0:18:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you saw anything.\NIt was quick but it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,looks like Narancia was\Npulled into this box.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The question is how he\Nwent where no that's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.94,0:18:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,totally impossible i mean\Nhe couldn't have plopped
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,straight into the ocean\Ncould he Naranja where
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.34,0:18:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hey Naranja? This\Nbetter not be a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say something, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.62,0:18:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.48,0:19:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.82,0:19:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.24,0:19:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're in on this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.20,0:19:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.16,0:19:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fugo! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Avakio, Giorno, I need the\Ntwo of you to stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A stowaway snuck aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.38,0:19:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And they have a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But why all of a sudden here? The money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Word must have gotten out that\NI know where the treasure lies,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and now they're after it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.92,0:19:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone else from the Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And how long do you think\Nthey've been stalking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.48,0:19:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible that\Nthey were at the docks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.16,0:19:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They knew I'd never mistakenly reveal\Nthe secret, so they got impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Our pursuer will kill you all\Nand try to force me to confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:20:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sitting sardines waiting out\Nhere, so they're taking their time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think the others are goners?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.76,0:20:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying that, but\Nten billion's at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't hesitate for a\Nsecond to kill one of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.64,0:20:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, the others are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.76,0:20:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're still somewhere on this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.14,0:20:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not at all certain if they're\Nbeing held hostage or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.28,0:20:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but they're alive at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You happen to have any proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't just take your word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I used my stand to turn\NNarancia's shoe into a fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and now that fly is trying\Nto return to its owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If Narancia had been killed, the fly\Nwouldn't be hovering and searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.56,0:20:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you locate him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive, but\Nsomething isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not descending into\Nthe lower cabin or locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems to be completely fixated with\Nsearching for Narancia over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what the hell is this guy's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:20:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.06,0:21:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia is somewhere over there by\Nthe cabin entrance. I'm positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.96,0:21:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But for some reason, it can't pinpoint\Nhis location, so it's disoriented.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.64,0:21:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We should consider Narancia's location\Nand the enemy's one and the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.82,0:21:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, the enemy is hiding, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're not simply in\Nthe shadows of the hull.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.28,0:21:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Va Bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless we can decipher\Nthe enemy's abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.38,0:21:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,a single misstep could\Ncost us our lives. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They may be able to attack while in\Nhiding, but that's also a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.34,0:21:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll study their stand and\Nlearn how to take them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The real battle begins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.96,0:21:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Abakio, our secret weapon\Nmight be your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.41,0:21:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have the ability\Nto solve this mystery?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.42,0:21:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.40,0:21:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Habakio!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope for all our sakes, you're not letting\Na hang-up get in the way of survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.68,0:21:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.18,0:21:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.22,0:22:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I value my safety far too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.70,0:22:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't reveal my stand to just anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,especially a complete stranger\Nwho has zero loyalty to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pucerati, I don't know why you're\Nplacing so much trust in this new guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.34,0:22:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But as far as I'm concerned,\Nhe is no associate of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.80,0:22:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't crack this mystery,\Nthe enemy will kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.12,0:22:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And how do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All of that crap is just this\Noutsider kid's random guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's his cowardice talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.66,0:22:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't seen anything. Habakio!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.22,0:22:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet that bastard is just\Nhiding out somewhere below deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.18,0:22:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll force them out here and\Ngive him a helping of payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.60,0:22:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you die first,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.24,0:22:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,which will likely happen if we\Nrush in without - Cork it, Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.94,0:22:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come what may, I refuse\Nto give up my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.44,0:22:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.92,0:22:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on. Solve it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.76,0:22:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let me down. Jonah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.82,0:23:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.96,0:23:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where the enemy's hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.30,0:23:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Merda!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.21,0:23:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.74,0:23:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Abbacchio?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna, you're one foley idiota\Nto go to these lengths to prove yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.02,0:23:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This kid's even crazier than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.60,0:23:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The marines don't do. you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.28,0:24:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you?
